Z||000000||fropuff||04-01-2000||07:45 PM||||Does anyone know the top speed of an 85 GT auto?||||reg||10
Z||000001||TOM||04-01-2000||08:10 PM||||I had my 86SE auto which is basically the same to around 112. It had more but I dont think it had much more. It was very stable.||||reg||1
Z||000002||GT Bastard||04-01-2000||09:20 PM||||Motorweeks auto V6 topped out at 115...  I was pretty dissapointed when I saw that.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Capt Fiero||04-01-2000||10:58 PM||||They will do 120mph.  I have had mine that fast.  I have a 180kph (120mph) speedo in my car and have been able to burry it.  My car only has minor mods, ported manifolds, MSD coil and K&N air filter just the basics.  I was also paced by an impala so I know that the speedo was not in total error.  And yes it is stable at those speeds.<BR>David.<BR>P,S it did take over a mile to get to that speed though.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Haze_Performance||04-02-2000||04:08 AM||||I have a 85 2M4 thats auto and my top speed so far was just over 105mph?? The needle was in the center of the third number of the trip meter. I had a little more to go but the little woman said  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> slow down or sleep in the garage  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  ..(So far the car is bone stock)<P>P.S. The car was very stable||||reg||14
